{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31036","headline":"桃花 · 薛能","name":"桃花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"香色自天种，千年岂易逢。\n开齐全未落，繁极欲相重。\n泠湿朝如淡，晴乾午更浓。\n风光新社燕，时节旧春农。\n篱落欹临竹，亭台盛间松。\n乱缘堪羡蚁，深入不如蜂。\n有影宜暄煦，无言自冶容。\n洞连非俗世，溪静接仙踪。\n子熟河应变，根盘土已封。\n西王潜爱惜，东朔盗过从。\n醉席眠英好，题诗恋景慵。\n芳菲聊一望，何必在临邛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31036.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31036","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}